# General Sans (ITF Free Font License) may be self-hosted but not redistributed through a
# public repository. Provision it per environment; see apps/web/public/fonts/LICENSES.md.
public/fonts/GeneralSans-*
# Isolated e2e stack state (local test credentials)
e2e/.stack/
# The root rule `coverage/` (test reports) would hide the /coverage route.
!app/(app)/coverage/
